      "rationale": "The paper supports trace-linked V&V artifacts at the generic CSRM/system-reference-model level through requirement and technical-measure links to validation/verification activities. It does not show EPS-specific verification, executable/model-based checks, simulation-in-the-loop, SIL/HIL, or physical integration/test evidence. Do not upgrade beyond trace-linked verification artifacts.",
